{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：18:49 2026-10-12 HKT<br/>發佈時間：18:49 2026-10-12 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：18:49 2026-10-12 HKT</p><p>德朗邨一名九旬婆婆疑遭虐打致死，警方拘捕52歲涉案印傭，涉嫌謀殺。警方在記者會提到，社會福利署有定期派員上門探訪婆婆。惟據了解，死者並非社署社工跟進個案，社署社工過去曾協助其處理經濟援助申請事宜。</p><p>社會福利署回覆查詢時表示，社署十分關注事件並深感難過。社署社工已聯絡有關家屬，提供情緒支援，並會按其需要提供適切協助。</p><img alt=\"現場為德朗邨德瑤樓。蕭文學攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/cc62cf017a0ef4f025adc4e5b8463ccf/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-12_at_14_29_39_2__0.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"現場為德朗邨德瑤樓。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/5e9c50634c913d3c1f09924ab13d5362/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-12_at_14_29_38_0.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"警方曾上樓調查。曾志恆攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/2ebc4c8385d3e00588212e36d1959051/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-12_at_18_12_04.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"警方曾上樓調查。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/aef57ca49612c142ada0d6a97bab9cb8/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-12_at_18_12_05.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"警方早前見記者交代案情。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/cfbc57148222594ae2a852bbc10e55b7/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-12_at_15_26_07_0.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-12T10:59:09.784056+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":241,"images":5,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"},"published_at":"2026-10-12T10:49:46+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-12T11:17:38.163802+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-12T10:57:39.372512+00:00","content_hash":"4b7505d62813cc08c88ca4c8022284f2f69ff5add3a6fbbd24fa6ca7843098f9","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null}